        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Susanna Thompson, Rob Reiner, Alec Baldwin, Whoopi Goldberg, James Woods\n- Works: Little Giants, Ghosts of Mississippi, Random Hearts, Dragonfly, Once and Again\n- Organizations: ABC\n- Topics: acting, film, television\n\nFacts:\n- Susanna Thompson was born on January 27, 1958, and she is an American actress.\n- Susanna Thompson appeared in the film Little Giants in 1994.\n- Ghosts of Mississippi is a 1996 American biographical courtroom drama film directed by Rob Reiner and starring Alec Baldwin, Whoopi Goldberg, and James Woods.\n- Susanna Thompson appeared in the film Ghosts of Mississippi in 1996.\n- Susanna Thompson appeared in the film Random Hearts in 1999.\n- Susanna Thompson played Karen Sammler on the ABC drama series Once and Again from 1999 to 2002.\n- Susanna Thompson appeared in the film Dragonfly in 2002.",
